Promote live Stripe webhook verification after Cloudflare signing-secret configuration.

This release keeps the existing £19 one-off Decision Pack and free initial evidence check unchanged. It preserves the current acquisition pages and production UI while hardening payment handling: Checkout Session creation is idempotent per quote case, Stripe metadata contains only an opaque case reference plus product marker, and signed webhook handling covers checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded and checkout.session.async_payment_failed.

The live webhook destination is https://homequotecheck.co.uk/api/stripe/webhook. STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET has now been configured manually as an encrypted Cloudflare Worker secret. Production deployment and existing smoke checks will rerun against the current payment-hardened worker.

